WEBVTT

00:09:58.954 --> 00:10:04.246
and therefore our mind
and memory, well stimulated.

00:10:04.579 --> 00:10:05.787
Thank you.

00:10:05.787 --> 00:10:11.912
(Applause)

00:10:11.954 --> 00:10:14.162
Chris Anderson: Thank you so very much.

00:10:14.162 --> 00:10:17.287
I actually would have so many questions,

00:10:17.329 --> 00:10:19.204
but the clock is not our friend.

00:10:19.246 --> 00:10:21.287
I'm going to ask you one.

00:10:24.329 --> 00:10:25.829
The cause of Alzheimer's,

00:10:25.871 --> 00:10:27.954
like, the implication
of what you're saying,

00:10:27.954 --> 00:10:30.829
is that it's possible
that an actual causal factor